- result: mm scale heights at 100 au, Models A,B,C = 3.3, 4.2, 0.3 ± not stated au [5.3: "$h_{1mm}$ = 3.3, 4.2, 0.3 au, respectively"]
- limitation (authors): Midplane thermal emission not vertically resolved; smooth tapered density model too simple [5.3: "since the vertical height of the disk in the ALMA data is not resolved"]
